{"component_id_namespace":"ec077a53-0b40-5f21-b1fe-a62094d2476b","component_schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","components":[{"attributes":{"code":"TMC","legacy_node_id":"ks-topeka:tmc:9.45.380","page_type":"section"},"citation":"9.45.380","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/9.45.380","content_hash":"b803a5471465d71f91df52d7f7aecec640240066a3af8fa12834e01098266e8d","heading":"Notice.","ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":null,"schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.380:section","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/9.45.380","text":"(a) Pre-Removal Notice. The written notice required by TMC 9.45.370 shall be deemed to have been served if a written notice is served on the person storing the personal property, or is posted conspicuously on or near the personal property. The written notice shall contain the following:\n(1) A general description of the personal property to be removed.\n(2) The location from which the personal property will be removed.\n(3) The date and time the notice was posted.\n(4) A statement that the personal property will be impounded if not removed within 24 hours.\n(5) A statement that moving stored personal property to another area covered by this article shall not be considered to be removing personal property.\n(6) The location where the removed personal property will be stored, including a telephone number and the internet website of the City through which a person may receive information as to impounded personal property.\n(7) A statement that impounded personal property may be discarded or otherwise disposed of if not claimed within 90 days after impoundment.\n(b) Post-Removal Notice. Upon removal of stored personal property, written notice shall be conspicuously placed in the area from which the personal property was removed. The written notice shall contain the following:\n(1) A general description of the personal property removed.\n(2) The date and approximate time the personal property was removed.\n(3) A statement that the personal property was stored in violation of TMC 9.45.370 .\n(4) The location where the removed personal property will be located, including a telephone number and internet website of the City through which a person may receive information as to impounded personal property.\n(5) A statement that impounded personal property may be discarded or otherwise disposed of if not claimed within 90 days after impoundment. (Ord. 20224 § 5, 12-3-19.)","type":"section","workbench_component_id":"f7c8f2a0-79e8-576d-9714-4c5cf25d51ed"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"9.45.380","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/9.45.380","content_hash":"183ef6e111cca475ab2c45bea3fe2f7b990ec7ed5ca58e09f7a8f8ac32129e06","heading":null,"ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.380:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.380:block:0","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/9.45.380","text":"(a) Pre-Removal Notice. The written notice required by TMC 9.45.370 shall be deemed to have been served if a written notice is served on the person storing the personal property, or is posted conspicuously on or near the personal property. The written notice shall contain the following:","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"a9e5bddb-f971-5df2-ba79-91e89c27026e"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"9.45.380","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/9.45.380","content_hash":"7814836e54b728395adf98f0c9a572f54d8a3e9bf5914f6c9f21561cd2c1bf6c","heading":null,"ordinal":1,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.380:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.380:block:1","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/9.45.380","text":"(1) A general description of the personal property to be removed.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"a5fe85d7-9059-5515-9faa-c484203d130d"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"9.45.380","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/9.45.380","content_hash":"af51001495017fc050e961fa1f2e90560282fb231a31e2a1f6de833f82d4d3a5","heading":null,"ordinal":2,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.380:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.380:block:2","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/9.45.380","text":"(2) The location from which the personal property will be removed.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"5d48a6de-cd9d-5af8-94f3-7368cb435203"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"9.45.380","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/9.45.380","content_hash":"bd8cc4eaa875ddf5f6c99ac188f5bb3db0e67158fc07904b51365d3c5868565f","heading":null,"ordinal":3,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.380:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.380:block:3","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/9.45.380","text":"(3) The date and time the notice was posted.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"443436a2-46ee-5b76-acaa-5d2dc855f85d"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"9.45.380","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/9.45.380","content_hash":"74d289a5f2b02d9bc5bf0cdca666e9cbb8a209bac02175be976710a5de3e9f27","heading":null,"ordinal":4,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.380:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:9.45.380:block:4","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/9.45.380","text":"(4) A statement that the personal property will be impounded if not removed within 24 